    "body": "I have another fun case where all browsers do something different.\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<div id=container><x-log><form id=target name=inner></form><x-fa form=target></x-fa></x-log></div>\n<form id=target name=outer></form>\n<pre id=out></pre>\n<script>\nconst log = [];\ncustomElements.define(\"x-log\", class extends HTMLElement {\n  disconnectedCallback() { log.push(\"x-log: disconnected\"); }\n});\ncustomElements.define(\"x-fa\", class extends HTMLElement {\n  static formAssociated = true;\n  disconnectedCallback() { log.push(\"x-fa: disconnected\"); }\n  formAssociatedCallback(form) { log.push(`x-fa: formAssociated(${form?.name ?? null})`); }\n});\nlog.length = 0;\ncontainer.firstChild.remove();\nout.textContent = log.join(\"\\n\");\n</script>\n```\n\n| Chrome | Firefox | Safari |\n--------------------------\n| <img width=\"218\" height=\"71\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1b695a2-ea7f-4fa1-a3df-8c8a5d8d3e25\" /> | <img width=\"217\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78a8f412-c83e-4cdc-bc9a-bb9948da49cc\" /> | <img width=\"212\" height=\"51\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2b2562d-0cae-4c11-b963-553ea7c5b3e0\" /> |",
